  "ingredients": [
    "8 ounce cream cheese (room temperature)",
    "6 ounce bacon",
    "5 ounce spinach",
    "1/2 cup sour cream",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "1 tablespoon ruled.me roasted garlic",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "2 1/2 ounce parmesan cheese (shredded)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out the cream cheese, which should be at room temperature.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0062.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the bacon over medium heat until crisp.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0073.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place onto paper towels and allow the excess grease to drain off to make the bacon extra crispy. Set aside. Preheat the oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0079.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach to the pan used to cook the bacon and cook in the bacon grease until wilted. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0086.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, add the cream cheese, sour cream, chopped parsley, and roasted garlic (see my recipe for this). Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0092.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix everything together well. Crumble in the bacon and mix again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0095.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the wilted spinach, excess bacon grease, and lemon juice. Mix everything together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0101.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grate the parmesan cheese and add it to the bowl. Mix everything together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0105.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the mixture into ramekins.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0109.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 25 minutes, then broil for an additional 3–4 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-and-roasted-garlic-spinach-dip/#wprm-recipe-51253-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
